    <script type="application/ld+json">{"mainEntity":{"headline":"Anxiety as a Moderator Between Autistic/ADHD Traits and Quality of Life in Autistic Children and Adolescents","description":"Anxiety is associated with lower well-being in autistic children, yet little is known about how anxiety symptoms moderate the relationship between neurodivergent traits and Quality of Life (QoL). The present study analyzed data from 316 clinician-diagnosed autistic children aged 7–17 from the Province of Ontario Neurodevelopmental Disorders Network. QoL, depression (as a control variable), anxiety, autistic traits, and ADHD traits were assessed. We expected anxiety to interact with autistic and ADHD traits in their associations with QoL domains. Regression analyses revealed that after controlling for depression, greater anxiety was associated with reduced school QoL. Additionally, greater ADHD hyperactive-impulsive (ADHD-HI) traits were associated with lower family QoL, while greater ADHD inattentive (ADHD-I) traits were associated with lower self-esteem QoL. Autistic traits were associated with lower friendship QoL but higher school QoL. There were interactions between ADHD-HI traits and anxiety. At high levels of anxiety, ADHD-HI traits were associated with higher school and self-esteem QoL. At low levels of anxiety, ADHD-HI traits were associated with lower friendship QoL. No significant associations were found for the interaction between ADHD-I traits and anxiety, or for the interaction between autistic traits and anxiety. These results introduce novel insights into how autistic traits, ADHD traits and anxiety interact in their associations with QoL in autistic children. Given that no corrections were made for multiple comparisons, this study should be considered exploratory and hypothesis-generating, intended to inspire future research that adopts a trait-based approach in studying the QoL of neurodiverse children.","datePublished":"2026-09-16T00:00:00Z","dateModified":"2026-09-16T00:00:00Z","pageStart":"1","pageEnd":"14","sameAs":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10803-026-07517-8","keywords":["Autism","Attention-deficit/hyperactivity disorder","Anxiety","Quality of life","Child and School Psychology","Pediatrics","Neurosciences","Public Health"],"image":["https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs10803-026-07517-8/MediaObjects/10803_2026_7517_Fig1_HTML.png","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs10803-026-07517-8/MediaObjects/10803_2026_7517_Fig2_HTML.png","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs10803-026-07517-8/MediaObjects/10803_2026_7517_Fig3_HTML.png"],"isPartOf":{"name":"Journal of Autism and Developmental Disorders","issn":["1573-3432","0162-3257"],"@type":["Periodical"]},"publisher":{"name":"Springer US","logo":{"url":"https://www.springernature.com/app-sn/public/images/logo-springernature.png","@type":"ImageObject"},"@type":"Organization"},"author":[{"name":"Samara Osten","affiliation":[{"name":"Queen’s University","address":{"name":"Department of Psychology, Queen’s University, Kingston, Canada","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"},{"name":"Currently at Brock University","address":{"name":"Currently at Brock University, St. Catherines, Canada","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Melissa Susko","affiliation":[{"name":"Queen’s University","address":{"name":"Department of Psychology, Queen’s University, Kingston, Canada","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Charee Botha","affiliation":[{"name":"Queen’s University","address":{"name":"Department of Psychology, Queen’s University, Kingston, Canada","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Jessica Jones","affiliation":[{"name":"Queen’s University","address":{"name":"Department of Psychology, Queen’s University, Kingston, Canada","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"},{"name":"Queen’s University","address":{"name":"Department of Psychiatry, Queen’s University, Kingston, Canada","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"},{"name":"Providence Care Hospital","address":{"name":"Providence Care Hospital, Kingston, Canada","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Marc Woodbury-Smith","affiliation":[{"name":"Queen’s University","address":{"name":"Department of Psychiatry, Queen’s University, Kingston, Canada","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"},{"name":"Providence Care Hospital","address":{"name":"Providence Care Hospital, Kingston, Canada","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Julia Frei","affiliation":[{"name":"McMaster University","address":{"name":"Department of Pediatrics, McMaster University, Hamilton, Canada","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Stelios Georgiades","affiliation":[{"name":"McMaster University","address":{"name":"Department of Psychiatry and Behavioural Neurosciences, McMaster University, Hamilton, Canada","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Rob Nicolson","affiliation":[{"name":"University of Western Ontario","address":{"name":"Department of Psychiatry, University of Western Ontario, London, Canada","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Elisabeta Trinari","affiliation":[{"name":"McMaster University","address":{"name":"Department of Pediatrics, McMaster University, Hamilton, Canada","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Evdokia Anagnostou","affiliation":[{"name":"Holland Bloorview Kids Rehabilitation Hospital","address":{"name":"Holland Bloorview Kids Rehabilitation Hospital, Toronto, Canada","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Elizabeth Kelley","url":"http://orcid.org/0000-0001-7742-6542","affiliation":[{"name":"Queen’s University","address":{"name":"Department of Psychology, Queen’s University, Kingston, Canada","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"},{"name":"Queen’s University","address":{"name":"Department of Psychiatry, Queen’s University, Kingston, Canada","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"},{"name":"Providence Care Hospital","address":{"name":"Providence Care Hospital, Kingston, Canada","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"email":"kelleyb@queensu.ca","@type":"Person"}],"isAccessibleForFree":false,"hasPart":{"isAccessibleForFree":false,"cssSelector":".main-content","@type":"WebPageElement"},"@type":"ScholarlyArticle"},"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage"}</script>

        
        
